# nested_modules

Native bindings for nested_modules

WebAssembly bindings for a `wasm32-unknown-unknown` build of the `nested_modules` library, linked with `--export-table --growable-table` (for example `RUSTFLAGS="-C link-arg=--export-table -C link-arg=--growable-table"`). `init()` loads `nested_modules.wasm` from next to this package, or from the path in `NESTED_MODULES_LIBRARY` on Node.js; pass a URL, bytes, or a compiled module to load it from elsewhere:

```js
import { init, graphics } from 'nested_modules';

await init();
```

<!-- END README.md -->
